    "content": "{\n  \"schema_version\": \"optomind.fullbody.payload.v1\",\n  \"language\": \"zh\",\n  \"research_question\": \"How does the gut microbiome modulate the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in solid tumours, and what mechanisms mediate that effect?\",\n  \"review_argument\": \"肠道微生物组通过分类学特征、代谢产物及免疫通路调节实体瘤患者对 ICI 的临床疗效，但证据强度因肿瘤类型、研究设计及干预策略而异。观察性关联证据在黑色素瘤中最强，NSCLC 和 RCC 次之，但关联不等于因果。机制证据主要来自动物模型，人类验证有限，特别是肿瘤微环境内代谢物浓度数据缺失（如肌苷仅有血浆数据）。干预策略在初治人群中显示希望（FMT-LUMINate ORR 75-80%），但在难治人群中效果有限（MITRIC ORR 0%），且安全性受 ICI 方案调节（Prevotella 相关心肌炎仅在双 ICI 背景下出现）。目前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据支持微生物干预的常规临床应用，未来研究需解决标准化、因果推断及人群分层问题。\",\n  \"user_request\": \"\",\n  \"target_reader\": \"\",\n  \"review_scope\": {\n    \"statement\": \"本综述聚焦于实体瘤（黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、结直肠癌等）患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（PD-1/PD-L1、CTLA-4 抑制剂）治疗期间，肠道微生物组对治疗疗效（ORR、PFS、OS）及毒性（irAEs）的调节作用。涵盖观察性关联证据（区分回顾性与前瞻性队列）、因果机制解析（免疫细胞、分子通路、代谢物）、外部干扰因素（抗生素、PPI、饮食）及微生物干预策略（FMT、益生菌、工程菌）的临床试验数据。明确排除血液系统恶性肿瘤及非免疫治疗背景下的微生物组研究（除非用于机制对比）。严格区分肠道微生物组与肿瘤内微生物组的作用边界。证据等级标注明确：观察性关联不推断因果，干预试验区分 I/II 期与 III 期，代谢物数据区分血浆与肿瘤组织浓度。\"\n  },\n  \"approved_plan\": {\n    \"canonical_book_reference\": \"approved_plan\",\n    \"sha256\": \"b08bdc1f745404a9b893a88495e44c04fa96945bb03a0460bb47281e85dbe7fb\",\n    \"normalized_outline_reference\": \"shared_fullbody_context\"\n  },\n  \"missing_original_context_fields\": [\n    \"user_request\",\n    \"target_reader\"\n  ],\n  \"editable_task_ids\": [\n    \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P01\",\n    \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P02\",\n    \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P03\",\n    \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P01\",\n    \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P02\",\n    \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P03\",\n    \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P01\",\n    \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P02\",\n    \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P03\",\n    \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P01\",\n    \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P02\",\n    \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P03\",\n    \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_T01\"\n  ],\n  \"chapters\": [\n    {\n      \"schema_version\": \"optomind.writer_candidates.payload.v1\",\n      \"chapter_id\": \"Ch1\",\n      \"language\": \"zh\",\n      \"chapter_frame\": {\n        \"chapter_title\": \"实体瘤中肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效的临床关联证据\",\n        \"chapter_purpose\": \"使读者能够准确评估不同实体瘤类型中肠道微生物特征与 ICI 临床结局的观察性关联强度，理解外部干扰因素与纵向动态对关联强度的修饰作用，并清晰区分当前证据的阶梯分布（从强观察性关联到弱干预性概念验证），避免将相关性误读为因果性或普适性生物标志物。\",\n        \"chapter_scope\": \"跨癌种观察性队列证实特定肠道微生物特征（分类学与功能通路）与 ICI 疗效存在显著关联，但缺乏普适性单一标志物；外部药物暴露（抗生素、PPIs）及联合治疗方案构成关键修饰变量，其影响具有明确的时间窗口特异性；基线单次采样难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，纵向动态变化比静态丰度更能反映真实疗效轨迹；当前证据呈现明显的阶梯状分布，概念验证性干预显示初步希望但异质性大，Phase III RCT 证据完全缺失，且安全性信号受 ICI 方案严格调节。\",\n        \"chapter_thesis\": \"跨癌种观察性队列证实特定肠道微生物特征（分类学与功能通路）与 ICI 疗效存在显著关联，但缺乏普适性单一标志物；外部药物暴露（抗生素、PPIs）及联合治疗方案构成关键修饰变量，其影响具有明确的时间窗口特异性；基线单次采样难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，纵向动态变化比静态丰度更能反映真实疗效轨迹；当前证据呈现明显的阶梯状分布，概念验证性干预显示初步希望但异质性大，Phase III RCT 证据完全缺失，且安全性信号受 ICI 方案严格调节。\",\n        \"chapter_argument\": \"跨癌种观察性队列证实特定肠道微生物特征（分类学与功能通路）与 ICI 疗效存在显著关联，但缺乏普适性单一标志物；外部药物暴露（抗生素、PPIs）及联合治疗方案构成关键修饰变量，其影响具有明确的时间窗口特异性；基线单次采样难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，纵向动态变化比静态丰度更能反映真实疗效轨迹；当前证据呈现明显的阶梯状分布，概念验证性干预显示初步希望但异质性大，Phase III RCT 证据完全缺失，且安全性信号受 ICI 方案严格调节。\",\n        \"reader_objective\": \"使读者能够准确评估不同实体瘤类型中肠道微生物特征与 ICI 临床结局的观察性关联强度，理解外部干扰因素与纵向动态对关联强度的修饰作用，并清晰区分当前证据的阶梯分布（从强观察性关联到弱干预性概念验证），避免将相关性误读为因果性或普适性生物标志物。\",\n        \"research_question\": \"How does the gut microbiome modulate the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in solid tumours, and what mechanisms mediate that effect?\",\n        \"review_argument\": \"肠道微生物组通过分类学特征、代谢产物及免疫通路调节实体瘤患者对 ICI 的临床疗效，但证据强度因肿瘤类型、研究设计及干预策略而异。观察性关联证据在黑色素瘤中最强，NSCLC 和 RCC 次之，但关联不等于因果。机制证据主要来自动物模型，人类验证有限，特别是肿瘤微环境内代谢物浓度数据缺失（如肌苷仅有血浆数据）。干预策略在初治人群中显示希望（FMT-LUMINate ORR 75-80%），但在难治人群中效果有限（MITRIC ORR 0%），且安全性受 ICI 方案调节（Prevotella 相关心肌炎仅在双 ICI 背景下出现）。目前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据支持微生物干预的常规临床应用，未来研究需解决标准化、因果推断及人群分层问题。\",\n        \"shared_scope\": {\n          \"statement\": \"本综述聚焦于实体瘤（黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、结直肠癌等）患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（PD-1/PD-L1、CTLA-4 抑制剂）治疗期间，肠道微生物组对治疗疗效（ORR、PFS、OS）及毒性（irAEs）的调节作用。涵盖观察性关联证据（区分回顾性与前瞻性队列）、因果机制解析（免疫细胞、分子通路、代谢物）、外部干扰因素（抗生素、PPI、饮食）及微生物干预策略（FMT、益生菌、工程菌）的临床试验数据。明确排除血液系统恶性肿瘤及非免疫治疗背景下的微生物组研究（除非用于机制对比）。严格区分肠道微生物组与肿瘤内微生物组的作用边界。证据等级标注明确：观察性关联不推断因果，干预试验区分 I/II 期与 III 期，代谢物数据区分血浆与肿瘤组织浓度。\"\n        },\n        \"review_argument_status\": \"calibrated\",\n        \"review_argument_source\": \"whole_plan_improvement\"\n      },\n      \"editable_task_ids\": [\n        \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P01\",\n        \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P02\",\n        \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P03\",\n        \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P01\",\n        \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P02\",\n        \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P03\",\n        \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P01\",\n        \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P02\",\n        \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P03\",\n        \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P01\",\n        \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P02\",\n        \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P03\",\n        \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_T01\"\n      ],\n      \"units\": [\n        {\n          \"unit_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱\",\n          \"focus\": \"跨癌种观察性队列证实特定肠道微生物特征（分类学与功能通路）与 ICI 疗效存在显著关联，但缺乏普适性单一标志物，证据强度呈癌种特异性分布。\",\n          \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P01\",\n              \"point\": \"展示跨癌种共性信号与癌种特异性分布\",\n              \"development\": \"先列举黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC 等队列中反复出现的阳性信号（如 Akkermansia muciniphila、Bifidobacterium longum、Faecalibacterium prausnitzii 富集及高α多样性），随后指出结直肠癌与肝细胞癌中部分信号反转或失效，说明证据强度呈癌种特异性分布。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供 NSCLC 背景下跨癌种的微生物特征清单，指出特定菌属富集与疗效正相关但存在阈值风险\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0146\",\n                  \"role\": \"背景\",\n                  \"use\": \"作为基础资源映射肠道微生物组组成与 ICI 疗效在实体瘤中的关系，提供特定微生物标记物\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供 JCOG2007 辅助研究数据，说明方案特异性及基线微生物与疗效关联\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0298\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供 NSCLC 与黑色素瘤的大样本荟萃分析数据，量化高α多样性及特定菌富集对 ICI 生存期的正向预后效应\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0204\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"展示 HCC 多界微生物组特征，揭示细菌/代谢物在持久获益与非获益组间的显著差异而真菌差异较小\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"报道 mCRPC 患者中 A. muciniphila 丰度与 ICI 疗效呈负相关，挑战跨癌种通用正相关假设\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0393\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供多界微生物组整合分析证据，证实高多样性及特定属组合与 ICI 疗效正相关，补充单一细菌视角的局限\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0565\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"系统综述黑色素瘤数据，揭示真菌失调与较差预后的关联，论证多界微生物生态对 ICI 疗效的综合调节作用\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0545\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供波兰队列中饮食模式与特定菌群协同影响抗 PD-1 疗效的实证，支撑微生物标志物具有人群与生活方式依赖性\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P01\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P01\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 1,\n                  \"point\": \"展示跨癌种共性信号与癌种特异性分布\",\n                  \"development\": \"先列举黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC 等队列中反复出现的阳性信号（如 Akkermansia muciniphila、Bifidobacterium longum、Faecalibacterium prausnitzii 富集及高α多样性），随后指出结直肠癌与肝细胞癌中部分信号反转或失效，说明证据强度呈癌种特异性分布。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0096\",\n                    \"P0146\",\n                    \"P0585\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"在黑色素瘤、NSCLC 和 RCC 队列中，Akkermansia muciniphila、Bifidobacterium longum 及 Faecalibacterium prausnitzii 富集与更好的 ICI 预后相关（P0096, P0146）；但在肝细胞癌及部分结直肠癌队列中，相同信号失效或反转（P0585）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P02\",\n              \"point\": \"解释跨队列异质性与“无通用标志物”的统计依据\",\n              \"development\": \"引用 PERMANOVA 分析结果，证明“队列”本身是解释微生物群落组成变异的最大因素（解释方差远超临床参数），机器学习跨队列泛化能力极差（留一法交叉验证平均 AUC-ROC 仅为 0.59-0.60），确认黑色素瘤 ICI 反应中微生物关联的复杂性和队列依赖性。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0478\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供跨队列荟萃分析结果，证明队列本身是解释微生物群落组成变异的最大因素，机器学习跨队列泛化能力极差\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0170\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"揭示微生物标志物的肠型特异性，解释为何单一物种难以成为普适性生物标志物\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0289\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"基于 SCRUM-Japan 大规模队列证实整体α多样性与 ICI 疗效无普遍关联，为无通用标志物提供关键反例\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0364\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"提出功能趋同理论框架，解释分类学不一致背后的共享免疫通路，支持向基于功能的生物标志物开发转型\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0437\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"展示基因水平微生物丰度结合生物先验知识在预测 ICI 反应中优于传统分类学特征\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0511\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"基于转移性黑色素瘤宏基因组荟萃分析，确认维生素 B 代谢通路富集与响应正相关，为功能趋同提供跨队列统计支持\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0015\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"证明菌株级签名在联合免疫治疗中具有泛癌种预测力，但在单药队列中失效，直接支撑缺乏普适性单一标志物的核心论点\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P02\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P02\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 2,\n                  \"point\": \"解释跨队列异质性与“无通用标志物”的统计依据\",\n                  \"development\": \"引用 PERMANOVA 分析结果，证明“队列”本身是解释微生物群落组成变异的最大因素（解释方差远超临床参数），机器学习跨队列泛化能力极差（留一法交叉验证平均 AUC-ROC 仅为 0.59-0.60），确认黑色素瘤 ICI 反应中微生物关联的复杂性和队列依赖性。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0478\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"在整合 5 个新测序队列（n=165）和 4 个公开数据集（n=147）后，PERMANOVA 分析显示“队列”因素对微生物群落组成的解释方差是其他任何变量的近十倍；留一法交叉验证的平均 AUC-ROC 仅为 0.59-0.60，仅约 31.4% 的情况超过 0.6（P0478）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P03\",\n              \"point\": \"阐明治疗方案与给药时序的修饰效应\",\n              \"development\": \"对比 NIC（尼莫鲁单抗 + 伊匹木单抗 + 铂类双药）与 PC 组，指出 Fusicatenibacter 和 Butyricicoccus 高丰度仅在 NIC 组中与更好 OS 相关（HR 分别为 0.56 和 0.52），而 Prevotellaceae NK3B31 高丰度在 NIC 组中与更高死亡风险相关（HR=2.33），说明微生物效应方向受具体给药方案严格修饰。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"对比 NIC 与 PC 组，指出特定菌高丰度仅在 NIC 组中与更好 OS 相关，说明微生物效应方向受具体给药方案严格修饰\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0015\",\n                  \"role\": \"补充\",\n                  \"use\": \"补充说明治疗策略（联合免疫阻断 vs 单药）对微生物信号泛化性的修饰作用\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P03\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P03\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 3,\n                  \"point\": \"阐明治疗方案与给药时序的修饰效应\",\n                  \"development\": \"对比 NIC（尼莫鲁单抗 + 伊匹木单抗 + 铂类双药）与 PC 组，指出 Fusicatenibacter 和 Butyricicoccus 高丰度仅在 NIC 组中与更好 OS 相关（HR 分别为 0.56 和 0.52），而 Prevotellaceae NK3B31 高丰度在 NIC 组中与更高死亡风险相关（HR=2.33），说明微生物效应方向受具体给药方案严格修饰。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0585\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"在 NIC 臂（Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy）vs PC 臂中，Fusicatenibacter 高丰度患者 HR=0.56，Butyricicoccus 高丰度患者 HR=0.52；Prevotellaceae NK3B31 高丰度患者 HR=2.33（P0585）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ],\n          \"table_tasks\": [],\n          \"owner_unit_context\": {\n            \"evidence_conditions\": \"\",\n            \"synthesis\": \"\",\n            \"transition\": \"既然基线快照与方案特异性已严重限制单一标志物的泛化，必须审视外部药物暴露如何进一步修饰这些关联。\",\n            \"argument_relations\": \"共性信号确立微生物-ICI 关联的生物学合理性 → 跨队列异质性统计依据否定普适性单一标志物假设 → 方案特异性修饰效应进一步限制泛化边界。\",\n            \"supporting_studies\": [\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供NSCLC背景下跨癌种（黑色素瘤、肾癌）的微生物特征清单，指出特定菌属富集与疗效正相关但存在阈值风险，支撑综述中“跨癌种共性信号与情境依赖性”的论述。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"261e0a3618ae7acf6e831646379929eff88857d5\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0096\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"揭示微生物标志物的肠型特异性（如E2肠型中Collinsella与响应相关），解释为何单一物种难以成为普适性生物标志物，为“无通用标志物”的统计依据提供群落背景视角。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"4a1e10851c0bf838d11646a65bc0ee57b10b940a\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0170\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"证明菌株级签名在联合免疫治疗中具有泛癌种预测力，但在单药队列中失效，直接支撑“治疗方案严格修饰微生物效应方向”及“缺乏普适性单一标志物”的核心论点。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"08a484e3c782bc9552d2df812bad2ec86f231edc\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0015\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供NSCLC与黑色素瘤的大样本荟萃分析数据，量化高α多样性及Akkermansia/Faecalibacterium富集对ICI生存期的正向预后效应，支撑“跨癌种共性信号”的论述。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"82318ae05cff1667b2348961675db67dee4d8360\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0298\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"展示HCC多界微生物组特征，揭示细菌/代谢物在持久获益与非获益组间的显著差异而真菌差异较小，用于论证微生物效应具有高度癌种特异性及多界异质性。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"58ddfd822378599d43b877cd0905dfe067a4375f\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0204\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"基于SCRUM-Japan大规模队列证实整体α多样性与ICI疗效无普遍关联，且粪便口腔细菌比例升高预测较差PFS（尤其合并PPI使用时），为“无通用标志物”及统计异质性提供关键反例。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"7fe882e8b39d1a041fd2fee47d9321c965f01aa5\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0289\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"报道mCRPC患者中A. muciniphila丰度与ICI疗效呈负相关，挑战跨癌种通用正相关假设，并验证ICI治疗期间菌群高度稳定，支撑治疗方案史修饰效应及基线决定论。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"74786f8df0c7648840756833a4b4bc49ace34be6\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0270\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供多界微生物组（细菌+真菌+古菌+病毒）整合分析证据，证实高多样性及特定属组合与ICI疗效正相关，补充单一细菌视角的局限，支撑“生态网络稳定性促进疗效”的观点。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"a9e58de949ced186b4882146c14b79b306ae9ef5\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0393\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提出“功能趋同”理论框架，解释分类学不一致背后的共享免疫通路（如SCFA产生、DC激活），为跨队列异质性提供机制整合视角，支持向基于功能的生物标志物开发转型。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"9dd62eb058feb9dbd44c28e9c8d004181dd8d19d\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0364\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"展示基因水平微生物丰度结合生物先验知识在预测ICI反应中优于传统分类学特征，揭示治疗策略（联合免疫阻断vs单药）对微生物信号泛化性的修饰作用，丰富标志物开发的维度。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"bfb5efeaf486304583ce74567d60f84cf138a0ae\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0437\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供波兰队列中饮食模式（高植物/低乳制品）与特定菌群协同影响抗PD-1疗效的实证，支撑“微生物标志物具有人群与生活方式依赖性”的分析。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"f31246cd559d1a06b99a32b0ee47bb1ce0265772\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0545\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"系统综述黑色素瘤数据，揭示真菌失调与较差预后的关联，补充单一细菌视角局限，论证多界微生物生态对ICI疗效的综合调节作用。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"f9a9ef8d406ee51983cd285f9e60fc41574ae937\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0565\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"基于转移性黑色素瘤宏基因组荟萃分析，确认维生素B代谢通路富集与响应正相关，为“功能趋同优于单一分类学标志物”提供跨队列统计支持。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"e533262a6b45c7d00cff83bd889cdc367c85f377\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0511\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"unit_notes\": \"\",\n          \"source_handles\": [\n            \"P0096\",\n            \"P0146\",\n            \"P0585\",\n            \"P0298\",\n            \"P0204\",\n            \"P0270\",\n            \"P0393\",\n            \"P0565\",\n            \"P0545\",\n            \"P0478\",\n            \"P0170\",\n            \"P0289\",\n            \"P0364\",\n            \"P0437\",\n            \"P0511\",\n            \"P0015\"\n          ],\n          \"editable_task_ids\": [\n            \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P01\",\n            \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P02\",\n            \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P03\"\n          ],\n          \"task_keys\": {\n            \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n              \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱::U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P01\",\n              \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱::U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P02\",\n              \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱::U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P03\"\n            ],\n            \"table_tasks\": []\n          },\n          \"local_editable_task_ids\": [\n            \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱::U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P01\",\n            \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱::U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P02\",\n            \"U1_跨癌种关联图谱::U1_跨癌种关联图谱_P03\"\n          ],\n          \"fullbody_task_keys\": {\n            \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n              \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P01\",\n              \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P02\",\n              \"Ch1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1::U1_%E8%B7%A8%E7%99%8C%E7%A7%8D%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%B0%B1_P03\"\n            ],\n            \"table_tasks\": []\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"unit_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景\",\n          \"focus\": \"外部药物暴露（抗生素、PPIs）及联合治疗方案构成关键混杂/修饰变量，其影响具有明确的时间窗口特异性和剂量依赖性，需在关联分析中严格校正。\",\n          \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P01\",\n              \"point\": \"量化抗生素/PPIs 暴露的效应量与时间窗特异性\",\n              \"development\": \"汇总 Meta 分析数据，指出抗生素使用与 OS 恶化（HR=1.61）、PFS 缩短（HR=1.43）及 ORR 降低（RR=0.58）显著相关；亚组分析证实负面关联在 ICI 治疗前后 [-45, 45] 天窗口内最强（β=0.2192, p=0.008），同期 PPIs 暴露亦导致 OS 恶化（HR≈1.31）。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0081\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"汇总 Meta 分析数据，指出抗生素使用与 OS 恶化、PFS 缩短及 ORR 降低显著相关\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0402\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"系统综述明确 ICI 启动前 30 天内的抗生素暴露是预后恶化的核心风险窗口，量化时间窗特异性\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0123\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"量化抗酸药（PPIs）使用导致链球菌增加及短 PFS 的关联，并对比化疗预处理对微生物组的持久影响\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0236\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供超 5 万名实体瘤患者的系统综述与荟萃分析数据，量化全身性抗生素暴露导致 PFS 和 OS 显著缩短的效应量\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0266\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"聚焦拉丁美洲 NSCLC 人群，证实抗生素暴露显著降低 OS 但未影响 PFS，提示地域/人群特征可能扰动微生物 - 疗效轴\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0275\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"针对 HCC 人群的 Meta 分析显示抗生素使用未显著恶化 ICI 疗效，提出肝硬化基线免疫抑制状态可能缓冲抗生素扰动\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0289\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"揭示质子泵抑制剂 (PPI) 使用者粪便中口腔细菌比例显著升高，且该特征在 PPI 亚组中与更差 PFS 趋势强相关\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0339\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供大样本荟萃分析数据，量化 PPI 使用与 ICI 生存结局恶化的关联，并细化使用时窗的效应差异\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0360\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供妇科肿瘤真实世界数据，明确抗生素使用时长（≥14 天）与 OS 显著缩短的独立关联\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P01\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P01\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 1,\n                  \"point\": \"量化抗生素/PPIs 暴露的效应量与时间窗特异性\",\n                  \"development\": \"汇总 Meta 分析数据，指出抗生素使用与 OS 恶化（HR=1.61）、PFS 缩短（HR=1.43）及 ORR 降低（RR=0.58）显著相关；亚组分析证实负面关联在 ICI 治疗前后 [-45, 45] 天窗口内最强（β=0.2192, p=0.008），同期 PPIs 暴露亦导致 OS 恶化（HR≈1.31）。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0081\",\n                    \"P0402\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"抗生素暴露与 OS 恶化（HR=1.61, 95% CI 1.44-1.81）、PFS 缩短（HR=1.43, 95% CI 1.27-1.60）及 ORR 降低（RR=0.58, 95% CI 0.51-0.66）显著相关；在 ICI 治疗前后 [-45, 45] 天窗口内使用抗生素，OS 恶化风险最高（β=0.2192, p=0.008）（P0081, P0402）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P02\",\n              \"point\": \"讨论联合方案对微生物效应的修饰与反转\",\n              \"development\": \"对比 NIC 与 PC 组，指出 Fusicatenibacter 和 Butyricicoccus 高丰度仅在 NIC 组中与更好 OS 相关（HR 分别为 0.56 和 0.52），而 Prevotellaceae NK3B31 高丰度在 NIC 组中与更高死亡风险相关（HR=2.33），说明联合方案可反转或放大微生物效应方向。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"对比 NIC 与 PC 组，指出特定菌高丰度仅在 NIC 组中与更好 OS 相关，说明联合方案可反转或放大微生物效应方向\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P02\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P02\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 2,\n                  \"point\": \"讨论联合方案对微生物效应的修饰与反转\",\n                  \"development\": \"对比 NIC 与 PC 组，指出 Fusicatenibacter 和 Butyricicoccus 高丰度仅在 NIC 组中与更好 OS 相关（HR 分别为 0.56 和 0.52），而 Prevotellaceae NK3B31 高丰度在 NIC 组中与更高死亡风险相关（HR=2.33），说明联合方案可反转或放大微生物效应方向。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0585\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"在 NIC 臂（Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy）vs PC 臂中，Fusicatenibacter 高丰度患者 HR=0.56，Butyricicoccus 高丰度患者 HR=0.52；Prevotellaceae NK3B31 高丰度患者 HR=2.33（P0585）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P03\",\n              \"point\": \"强调校正必要性与残余偏倚风险\",\n              \"development\": \"指出指示偏倚（Indication Bias）可能导致抗生素负面效应被高估；强调未来研究需标准化暴露定义（种类、剂量、持续时间、指征）并进行多变量校正，否则单纯检测微生物组而不考虑用药史会导致结果不一致。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0081\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"指出指示偏倚可能导致抗生素负面效应被高估，强调未来研究需标准化暴露定义并进行多变量校正\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0402\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提示需区分暴露时机进行校正，否则单纯检测微生物组而不考虑用药史会导致结果不一致\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0157\",\n                  \"role\": \"补充\",\n                  \"use\": \"汇总抗生素、PPIs 及类固醇暴露对 ICI 预后的负面效应量，为讨论指示偏倚高估负面效应及需标准化校正提供实证对照\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0033\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"展示 PPI 使用者与非使用者在微生物动态轨迹上的显著差异，说明合并用药可重塑菌群演化路径，需在关联分析中作为关键协变量严格校正\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0421\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供肌肉量这一非微生物宿主因素对 ICI 疗效影响的实证数据，作为对比背景说明除菌群外其他宿主因素的预测价值存在异质性\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0517\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"证实 NSCLC 中抗生素暴露的负面效应高度依赖 PD-L1 表达水平，为宿主生物标志物状态严格修饰微生物干预效应方向提供临床分层依据\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0548\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"整合多尺度证据指出抗生素效应在不同实体瘤中存在异质性，警示简单归因于菌群破坏，强调需结合肿瘤免疫原性与疾病背景综合评估\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P03\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P03\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 3,\n                  \"point\": \"强调校正必要性与残余偏倚风险\",\n                  \"development\": \"指出指示偏倚（Indication Bias）可能导致抗生素负面效应被高估；强调未来研究需标准化暴露定义（种类、剂量、持续时间、指征）并进行多变量校正，否则单纯检测微生物组而不考虑用药史会导致结果不一致。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0081\",\n                    \"P0402\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"观察性研究中的指示偏倚（重症患者更多使用抗生素）可能导致抗生素负面效应被高估；标准化暴露定义与多变量校正是避免结果不一致的必要前提（P0081, P0402）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ],\n          \"table_tasks\": [],\n          \"owner_unit_context\": {\n            \"evidence_conditions\": \"\",\n            \"synthesis\": \"\",\n            \"transition\": \"外部干扰虽可量化，但基线单次采样仍难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，必须转向纵向动态监测。\",\n            \"argument_relations\": \"量化暴露效应与时间窗特异性 → 联合方案修饰/反转效应方向 → 强调校正必要性与残余偏倚风险，确立外部干扰作为核心混杂/修饰变量的地位。\",\n            \"supporting_studies\": [\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"量化抗酸药（PPIs）使用导致链球菌增加及短PFS的关联，并对比化疗预处理对微生物组的持久影响，支撑“外部药物暴露具有明确时间窗特异性与剂量依赖性”的分析任务。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"35f3b135b6c865df8bb304e1f28a8247e55c25fd\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0123\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"汇总抗生素、PPIs及类固醇暴露对ICI预后的负面效应量，特别强调抗生素使用时机（治疗后vs治疗前）的差异，为讨论指示偏倚高估负面效应及需标准化校正提供实证对照。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"45ca27020bec6c917c6b71d8b1bad217f5abd0ed\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0157\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"展示PPI使用者与非使用者在微生物动态轨迹上的显著差异（如Streptococcus thermophilus变化方向相反），说明合并用药可重塑菌群演化路径，需在关联分析中作为关键协变量严格校正。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"0f25b980517704cd7fa782dd9e51d16b77d00249\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0033\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供超5万名实体瘤患者的系统综述与荟萃分析数据，量化全身性抗生素暴露导致PFS和OS显著缩短的效应量，确立抗生素作为负面预后调节因子的流行病学证据等级。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"62379160afa6c14c9a9ae85a0684ccec8ed9c07e\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0236\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"聚焦拉丁美洲NSCLC人群，证实抗生素暴露显著降低OS但未影响PFS，提示地域/人群特征可能扰动微生物-疗效轴，补充外部干扰效应的群体异质性背景。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"70ba511d3bb0697cd93e53d4880c68ce77471bde\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0266\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"揭示质子泵抑制剂(PPI)使用者粪便中口腔细菌比例显著升高，且该特征在PPI亚组中与更差PFS趋势强相关，阐明合并用药通过重塑肠道生态位构成关键混杂/修饰变量。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"7fe882e8b39d1a041fd2fee47d9321c965f01aa5\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0289\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"针对HCC人群的Meta分析显示抗生素使用未显著恶化ICI疗效(OS/PFS/ORR)，提出肝硬化基线免疫抑制状态可能缓冲抗生素扰动，为讨论指示偏倚及肿瘤类型特异性校正必要性提供反面对照。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"768ceed11b5509cd8f6c24d07e8fa015646929c0\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0275\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供大样本荟萃分析数据，量化PPI使用与ICI生存结局恶化的关联，并细化使用时窗（基线/前60天 vs 同期）的效应差异，为讨论药物暴露的时间依赖性干扰提供流行病学基准。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"9225e04c4f9620a87d4eb74932067cab87644bf2\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0339\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供妇科肿瘤真实世界数据，明确抗生素使用时长（≥14天）与OS显著缩短的独立关联，区分短期反应指标与长期生存获益的差异，强化用药阈值效应的临床证据。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"9cfb62b17064ed5abe1c447f8fa2f46e716b6c0d\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0360\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供肌肉量这一非微生物宿主因素对ICI疗效影响的实证数据，显示低肌肉量在肺癌中未降低PFS且不增加毒性，作为对比背景说明除菌群外其他宿主因素的预测价值存在异质性。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"b7d5f0bd4b9b2ff5ccb0fca4182d84c2111a7fdf\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0421\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"证实NSCLC中抗生素暴露的负面效应高度依赖PD-L1表达水平，为“宿主生物标志物状态严格修饰微生物干预效应方向”提供临床分层依据。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"e8fb88935a5c5757dc683f56d1ff0c0f356b20ae\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0517\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"系统综述明确ICI启动前30天内的抗生素暴露是预后恶化的核心风险窗口，同期暴露影响较弱，量化时间窗特异性并提示需区分暴露时机进行校正。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:286786239\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0576\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"整合多尺度证据指出抗生素效应在不同实体瘤中存在异质性，警示简单归因于“菌群破坏”，强调需结合肿瘤免疫原性与疾病背景综合评估。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"f381ac20e0012cee8a359a479037e3d12ee6e878\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0548\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"unit_notes\": \"\",\n          \"source_handles\": [\n            \"P0081\",\n            \"P0402\",\n            \"P0123\",\n            \"P0236\",\n            \"P0266\",\n            \"P0275\",\n            \"P0289\",\n            \"P0339\",\n            \"P0360\",\n            \"P0585\",\n            \"P0157\",\n            \"P0033\",\n            \"P0421\",\n            \"P0517\",\n            \"P0548\",\n            \"P0576\"\n          ],\n          \"editable_task_ids\": [\n            \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P01\",\n            \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P02\",\n            \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P03\"\n          ],\n          \"task_keys\": {\n            \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n              \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景::U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P01\",\n              \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景::U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P02\",\n              \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景::U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P03\"\n            ],\n            \"table_tasks\": []\n          },\n          \"local_editable_task_ids\": [\n            \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景::U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P01\",\n            \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景::U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P02\",\n            \"U2_外部干扰与宿主背景::U2_外部干扰与宿主背景_P03\"\n          ],\n          \"fullbody_task_keys\": {\n            \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n              \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P01\",\n              \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P02\",\n              \"Ch1::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF::U2_%E5%A4%96%E9%83%A8%E5%B9%B2%E6%89%B0%E4%B8%8E%E5%AE%BF%E4%B8%BB%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF_P03\"\n            ],\n            \"table_tasks\": []\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"unit_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变\",\n          \"focus\": \"基线单次采样难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，纵向动态变化（如病原菌清除或定植失败）比静态丰度更能反映真实疗效轨迹，但纵向数据收集仍面临方法学挑战。\",\n          \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P01\",\n              \"point\": \"对比基线快照的预测局限与静态阈值缺陷\",\n              \"development\": \"指出早期 NSCLC 新辅助研究中，基线快照难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，静态阈值缺陷明显；纵向动态变化（如病原菌清除或定植失败）比静态丰度更能反映真实疗效轨迹。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0569\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"报道早期 NSCLC 新辅助治疗中低基线α多样性与高纵向稳定性预示较好病理缓解，对比晚期研究结果\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"指出基线单次采样难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，纵向动态变化比静态丰度更能反映真实疗效轨迹\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0227\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供 NSCLC 与黑色素瘤纵向队列数据，证明治疗初期微生物稳定性丧失独立于抗生素暴露且与 ICI 耐药显著相关\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0443\",\n                  \"role\": \"补充\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供 NSCLC 物种水平微生物特征与 PFS 及 PD-L1 状态的关联数据，证实化疗预处理虽扰动菌群但不消除特异性预测信号\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P01\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P01\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 1,\n                  \"point\": \"对比基线快照的预测局限与静态阈值缺陷\",\n                  \"development\": \"指出早期 NSCLC 新辅助研究中，基线快照难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，静态阈值缺陷明显；纵向动态变化（如病原菌清除或定植失败）比静态丰度更能反映真实疗效轨迹。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0569\",\n                    \"P0585\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"早期 NSCLC 新辅助研究中，基线快照难以捕捉治疗诱导的生态重塑，静态阈值缺陷明显；纵向动态变化（如病原菌清除或定植失败）比静态丰度更能反映真实疗效轨迹（P0569, P0585）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P02\",\n              \"point\": \"展示纵向动态演变（病原菌清除/定植失败）的预测价值\",\n              \"development\": \"引用 FMT-LUMINate 试验数据，指出响应者获益主要源于基线有害细菌物种（如 Enterocloster, Clostridium）的大量丢失，而非供体菌株的成功定植；这种丢失与血浆中色氨酸代谢产物水平降低及效应性 CD8+ T 细胞增加相关。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"引用 FMT-LUMINate 试验数据，指出响应者获益主要源于基线有害细菌物种的大量丢失，而非供体菌株的成功定植\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"记录 ICI 治疗期间循环 Tregs 减少与基线拟杆菌属丰度的纵向关联，提示微生物组可能通过设定免疫稳态临界点影响疗效\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0134\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供小规模前瞻性配对样本数据，显示响应者伴随显著的微生物组波动，而无响应者相对稳定或恶化\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0200\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"展示晚期 NSCLC 患者纵向多组学轨迹，发现响应者治疗后微生物特征向健康状态回归而进展期均恶化\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0205\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"针对 EGFR 突变 NSCLC 亚群，记录治疗前后微生物 U 型与倒 U 型动态演变模式及特定代谢物变化\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0415\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供人类黑色素瘤患者宏基因组与宏转录组联合分析证据，识别与 PFS 相关的特定代谢通路及其转录活性\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0485\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供黏膜黑色素瘤前瞻性队列初步数据，揭示响应者与非响应者肠道菌群组成差异及肿瘤微环境 CD56/CD20 表达平行变化\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"详述 MIMic 试验中供体菌株定植动力学与临床获益的关联，指出持久定植者获得更长生存\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0033\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"通过贝叶斯模型证实基线后微生物 SGBs 的持续积累轨迹比静态丰度更能区分长/短 PFS 患者\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P02\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P02\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 2,\n                  \"point\": \"展示纵向动态演变（病原菌清除/定植失败）的预测价值\",\n                  \"development\": \"引用 FMT-LUMINate 试验数据，指出响应者获益主要源于基线有害细菌物种（如 Enterocloster, Clostridium）的大量丢失，而非供体菌株的成功定植；这种丢失与血浆中色氨酸代谢产物水平降低及效应性 CD8+ T 细胞增加相关。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0585\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"在 FMT-LUMINate 试验中，响应者获益主要源于基线有害细菌物种（如 Enterocloster, Clostridium）的大量丢失，而非供体菌株的成功定植；这种丢失与血浆中色氨酸代谢产物水平降低及效应性 CD8+ T 细胞增加相关（P0585）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P03\",\n              \"point\": \"指出纵向采样面临的现实障碍与标准化需求\",\n              \"development\": \"强调当前领域缺乏前瞻性验证、技术标准化不足、地理多样性缺乏，呼吁开展大型多中心队列研究和随机干预试验；指出纵向采样需解决采集频率、存储条件及 AI 辅助语言工具辅助的语言精炼问题。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"强调当前领域缺乏前瞻性验证、技术标准化不足、地理多样性缺乏，呼吁开展大型多中心队列研究和随机干预试验\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n                  \"role\": \"背景\",\n                  \"use\": \"指出纵向采样需解决采集频率、存储条件及语言精炼问题\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0327\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"报告 NSCLC 基线队列中肠道微生物组成、SCFA 谱及肠屏障通透性指标均未能预测 ICI 反应或 irAEs，指出标准化缺失与参考值未建立是主要方法学障碍\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0546\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"梳理活体生物制品与后生元在临床试验中的动态监测需求，指出标准化采样频率与存储条件缺失是阻碍纵向数据转化为临床决策的主要方法学瓶颈\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P03\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P03\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 3,\n                  \"point\": \"指出纵向采样面临的现实障碍与标准化需求\",\n                  \"development\": \"强调当前领域缺乏前瞻性验证、技术标准化不足、地理多样性缺乏，呼吁开展大型多中心队列研究和随机干预试验；指出纵向采样需解决采集频率、存储条件及 AI 辅助语言工具辅助的语言精炼问题。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0584\",\n                    \"P0273\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"当前领域缺乏前瞻性验证、技术标准化不足、地理多样性缺乏，呼吁开展大型多中心队列研究和随机干预试验；纵向采样需解决采集频率、存储条件及 AI 辅助语言工具辅助的语言精炼问题（P0584, P0273）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ],\n          \"table_tasks\": [],\n          \"owner_unit_context\": {\n            \"evidence_conditions\": \"\",\n            \"synthesis\": \"\",\n            \"transition\": \"纵向监测虽优，但当前证据整体仍停留在观察性阶段，必须审视干预性研究的阶梯分布与安全边界。\",\n            \"argument_relations\": \"基线快照局限 → 纵向动态预测价值 → 现实障碍与标准化需求，确立纵向监测优于静态快照的方法学共识。\",\n            \"supporting_studies\": [\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"通过贝叶斯模型证实基线后微生物SGBs的持续积累轨迹比静态丰度更能区分长/短PFS患者，直接支撑“纵向动态变化优于单次基线采样”的方法学主张。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"0f25b980517704cd7fa782dd9e51d16b77d00249\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0033\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供小规模前瞻性配对样本数据，显示响应者伴随显著的微生物组波动（如梭菌属增加），而无响应者相对稳定或恶化，为“病原菌清除或定植失败反映真实疗效轨迹”提供早期实证。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"3bb355ee930e0893c48cf56a7164df771bf2d7f5\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0134\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"记录ICI治疗期间循环Tregs减少与基线拟杆菌属丰度的纵向关联，提示微生物组可能通过设定免疫稳态“临界点”影响疗效，补充了纵向监测中免疫-微生物互作的动态机制线索。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"2709ffca937655fdff12c871b14cb93ee1830d79\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0098\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供NSCLC与黑色素瘤纵向队列数据，证明治疗初期微生物稳定性丧失独立于抗生素暴露且与ICI耐药显著相关，支持动态监测优于静态采样的核心主张。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"5e9212b7607472bd4faf0f6e2385c37552c9821c\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0227\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"展示晚期NSCLC患者纵向多组学轨迹，发现响应者治疗后微生物特征向健康状态回归而进展期均恶化，并开发结合TMB的跨人群微生物评分，阐释动态演变与多模态分层的临床价值。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"57133de914bfeefa962dacc91943374147c07fff\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0200\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"针对EGFR突变NSCLC亚群，记录治疗前后微生物U型与倒U型动态演变模式及特定代谢物(脱氧胆酸、L-瓜氨酸)变化，说明驱动基因背景下的纵向生态重塑特征。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"590fbadadd7e854b3435c77a34e74cd5b744c084\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0205\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"报告NSCLC基线队列中肠道微生物组成、SCFA谱及肠屏障通透性指标均未能预测ICI反应或irAEs，指出标准化缺失与参考值未建立是纵向/横断面生物标志物转化的主要方法学障碍。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"8b3aa2316f5ec9089bf4d5f6cefbb1c1be74ad79\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0327\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供人类黑色素瘤患者宏基因组与宏转录组联合分析证据，识别与PFS相关的特定代谢通路（氨基酸合成、维生素合成）及其转录活性，为纵向动态变化提供分子层面的候选机制线索。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"b63bda99b7dbfd8c9d82d9a7246125da767de5c7\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0415\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供NSCLC物种水平微生物特征与PFS及PD-L1状态的关联数据，证实化疗预处理虽扰动菌群但不消除特异性预测信号，支持动态监测中治疗史独立性的论证。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"c39938e0fe05e9c9d70243715a4b8f8524d956a9\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0443\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供黏膜黑色素瘤前瞻性队列初步数据，揭示响应者与非响应者肠道菌群组成差异及肿瘤微环境CD56/CD20表达平行变化，补充罕见实体瘤亚型中纵向生态重塑的早期实证。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"da741d94b4d509b96c9490a118677edf3d1417a7\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0485\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"报道早期NSCLC新辅助治疗中低基线α多样性与高纵向稳定性预示较好病理缓解，对比晚期研究结果，阐明疾病阶段与治疗强度对动态标志物的情境修饰。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"fbbf5b7b16fb493ff4f0b84691ccb2b202d25d41\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0569\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"详述MIMic试验中供体菌株定植动力学与临床获益的关联，指出持久定植者获得更长生存，为“纵向生态重塑轨迹优于单次静态丰度”提供因果验证线索。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"20c143d5373eab0bfea2067cf66b0e260dfeb1ef\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0577\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"梳理活体生物制品与后生元在临床试验中的动态监测需求，指出标准化采样频率与存储条件缺失是阻碍纵向数据转化为临床决策的主要方法学瓶颈。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"f32b23ec68d527d1114ddf96e609079a09947e6e\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0546\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"unit_notes\": \"\",\n          \"source_handles\": [\n            \"P0569\",\n            \"P0585\",\n            \"P0227\",\n            \"P0443\",\n            \"P0098\",\n            \"P0134\",\n            \"P0200\",\n            \"P0205\",\n            \"P0415\",\n            \"P0485\",\n            \"P0577\",\n            \"P0033\",\n            \"P0584\",\n            \"P0273\",\n            \"P0327\",\n            \"P0546\"\n          ],\n          \"editable_task_ids\": [\n            \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P01\",\n            \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P02\",\n            \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P03\"\n          ],\n          \"task_keys\": {\n            \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n              \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变::U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P01\",\n              \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变::U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P02\",\n              \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变::U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P03\"\n            ],\n            \"table_tasks\": []\n          },\n          \"local_editable_task_ids\": [\n            \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变::U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P01\",\n            \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变::U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P02\",\n            \"U3_动态监测与纵向演变::U3_动态监测与纵向演变_P03\"\n          ],\n          \"fullbody_task_keys\": {\n            \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n              \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P01\",\n              \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P02\",\n              \"Ch1::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98::U3_%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%9B%91%E6%B5%8B%E4%B8%8E%E7%BA%B5%E5%90%91%E6%BC%94%E5%8F%98_P03\"\n            ],\n            \"table_tasks\": []\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"unit_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界\",\n          \"focus\": \"当前证据呈现明显的阶梯状分布：观察性关联最强，概念验证性干预（FMT）显示初步希望但异质性大，Phase III RCT 证据完全缺失，且安全性信号受 ICI 方案严格调节。\",\n          \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P01\",\n              \"point\": \"总结观察性证据强度与概念验证性干预的初步希望\",\n              \"development\": \"指出观察性关联证据最强，概念验证性干预（FMT）显示初步希望但异质性大；FMT-LUMINate II 期试验报告了 NSCLC 患者 ORR 为 80%，并指出响应者基线有害菌种丢失，而非供体菌株定植。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"报告 FMT-LUMINate II 期试验中 NSCLC 患者 ORR 达 80%，且响应源于基线有害菌种丢失而非供体定植\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"提出肠道 - 代谢物 - 免疫轴框架，详述特定代谢物在减轻 irAEs 同时维持抗肿瘤活性的潜力\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0026\",\n                  \"role\": \"背景\",\n                  \"use\": \"系统梳理 FMT 克服耐药的初步临床数据及机器学习预测性能，明确指出当前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据且方法学异质性大\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0144\",\n                  \"role\": \"背景\",\n                  \"use\": \"汇总 FMT 及益生菌干预的早期临床试验结果，强调多数证据来自病例报告或小样本系列研究\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0161\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"对比 FMT、益生菌与饮食干预的临床效果差异，指出普通益生菌使用结果高度依赖菌株特异性\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0291\",\n                  \"role\": \"背景\",\n                  \"use\": \"系统梳理早期 FMT 及定义菌群临床试验现状，强调多数证据来自小样本探索性研究且缺乏大型 RCT 确证\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0387\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"系统对比三类微生物干预措施的临床结局，指出 FMT 在难治性肿瘤中表现较一致 ORR 提升而益生菌效果高度特异\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0470\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供涵盖特定菌属富集、抗生素暴露及 FMT 效果的定量荟萃分析结果，汇总群体水平的统计关联证据\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0573\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"对比 FMT、益生菌与工程菌的临床转化现状，指出供体筛选标准与给药方案异质性是导致概念验证试验结果分化的主因\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P01\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P01\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 1,\n                  \"point\": \"总结观察性证据强度与概念验证性干预的初步希望\",\n                  \"development\": \"指出观察性关联证据最强，概念验证性干预（FMT）显示初步希望但异质性大；FMT-LUMINate II 期试验报告了 NSCLC 患者 ORR 为 80%，并指出响应者基线有害菌种丢失，而非供体菌株定植。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0583\",\n                    \"P0584\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"观察性关联证据最强，概念验证性干预（FMT）显示初步希望但异质性大；FMT-LUMINate II 期试验报告了 NSCLC 患者 ORR 为 80%，并指出响应者基线有害菌种丢失，而非供体菌株定植（P0583, P0584）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P02\",\n              \"point\": \"对比阴性干预试验（MITRIC）与供体匹配/疾病进展速度的限制\",\n              \"development\": \"对比 MITRIC IIa 期篮子试验阴性结果（ORR 0%），指出快速进展性疾病背景、供体匹配次优及免疫微环境限制（髓系主导、IL-8 升高）是疗效受限的主因，强调供体选择与疾病状态对 FMT 成败的决定性作用。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"详述 MITRIC IIa 期篮子试验阴性结果 (ORR 0%)，剖析快速进展疾病背景、供体匹配次优及髓系主导微环境限制等失败主因\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P02\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P02\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 2,\n                  \"point\": \"对比阴性干预试验（MITRIC）与供体匹配/疾病进展速度的限制\",\n                  \"development\": \"对比 MITRIC IIa 期篮子试验阴性结果（ORR 0%），指出快速进展性疾病背景、供体匹配次优及免疫微环境限制（髓系主导、IL-8 升高）是疗效受限的主因，强调供体选择与疾病状态对 FMT 成败的决定性作用。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0578\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"MITRIC IIa 期篮子试验阴性结果（ORR 0%），指出快速进展性疾病背景、供体匹配次优及免疫微环境限制（髓系主导、IL-8 升高）是疗效受限的主因，强调供体选择与疾病状态对 FMT 成败的决定性作用（P0578/MITRIC）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"paragraph_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P03\",\n              \"point\": \"强调 Phase III 空白与安全信号的情境依赖性\",\n              \"development\": \"强调目前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据支持微生物干预的常规临床应用；安全信号（如心肌炎）仅在双 ICI 背景下出现（Prevotella 相关），单药抗 PD-1 未观察到类似毒性，凸显安全性受 ICI 方案严格调节。\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n                  \"role\": \"主论据\",\n                  \"use\": \"强调目前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据支持微生物干预的常规临床应用\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n                  \"role\": \"背景\",\n                  \"use\": \"强调目前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据支持微生物干预的常规临床应用\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"指出安全信号（如心肌炎）仅在双 ICI 背景下出现，单药抗 PD-1 未观察到类似毒性\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n                  \"role\": \"例证\",\n                  \"use\": \"阐述 A. muciniphila 高丰度虽延长 NSCLC 患者 OS 但增加 irAE 风险，明确疗效与毒性在微生物层面的耦合关系\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0462\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供肺癌幸存者长期随访数据，揭示获益者特有的紧凑微生物网络与丁酸高产能力，以及 irAEs 患者的分子模拟表位富集\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n                  \"role\": \"发展\",\n                  \"use\": \"通过人源化小鼠 FMT 实验确立 irAEs 发生的微生物因果链，并构建随机森林预测模型\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"carried_over\": true,\n              \"point_changed_from_brief\": false,\n              \"source_briefs\": [\n                \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P03\"\n              ],\n              \"source_brief_details\": [\n                {\n                  \"paragraph_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P03\",\n                  \"unit_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界\",\n                  \"ordinal\": 3,\n                  \"point\": \"强调 Phase III 空白与安全信号的情境依赖性\",\n                  \"development\": \"强调目前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据支持微生物干预的常规临床应用；安全信号（如心肌炎）仅在双 ICI 背景下出现（Prevotella 相关），单药抗 PD-1 未观察到类似毒性，凸显安全性受 ICI 方案严格调节。\",\n                  \"source_handles\": [\n                    \"P0584\",\n                    \"P0273\",\n                    \"P0583\"\n                  ],\n                  \"finding_conditions\": \"目前缺乏 Phase III RCT 证据支持微生物干预的常规临床应用；安全信号（如心肌炎）仅在双 ICI 背景下出现（Prevotella 相关），单药抗 PD-1 未观察到类似毒性，凸显安全性受 ICI 方案严格调节（P0584, P0273, P0583）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ],\n          \"table_tasks\": [\n            {\n              \"table_id\": \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_T01\",\n              \"purpose\": \"比较当前主要微生物干预临床试验的设计、人群、疗效结果及局限性，直观展示证据阶梯分布。\",\n              \"columns\": [\n                \"试验名称/阶段\",\n                \"目标人群\",\n                \"干预策略\",\n                \"主要疗效结果 (ORR/PFS)\",\n                \"关键局限性/失败原因\"\n              ],\n              \"row_tasks\": [\n                {\n                  \"content\": \"FMT-LUMINate (Phase 2)\",\n                  \"source_uses\": [\n                    {\n                      \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                      \"role\": \"比较\",\n                      \"use\": \"提供 NSCLC 患者 ORR 达 80% 的数据及响应归因于有害菌丢失\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                {\n                  \"content\": \"MITRIC (Phase 2a)\",\n                  \"source_uses\": [\n                    {\n                      \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n                      \"role\": \"比较\",\n                      \"use\": \"提供 ORR 0% 的阴性结果及快速进展疾病背景等失败主因\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                {\n                  \"content\": \"MIMic (Phase 1)\",\n                  \"source_uses\": [\n                    {\n                      \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n                      \"role\": \"比较\",\n                      \"use\": \"提供供体菌株定植动力学与临床获益的关联数据\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                {\n                  \"content\": \"早期 FMT/益生菌综述\",\n                  \"source_uses\": [\n                    {\n                      \"source_handle\": \"P0026\",\n                      \"role\": \"比较\",\n                      \"use\": \"提供 ORR 约 20% 的初步临床数据及机器学习预测性能\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                      \"source_handle\": \"P0144\",\n                      \"role\": \"比较\",\n                      \"use\": \"强调多数证据来自病例报告或小样本系列研究\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                },\n                {\n                  \"content\": \"干预策略对比 (FMT vs 益生菌)\",\n                  \"source_uses\": [\n                    {\n                      \"source_handle\": \"P0387\",\n                      \"role\": \"比较\",\n                      \"use\": \"指出 FMT 在难治性肿瘤中表现较一致 ORR 提升而益生菌效果高度特异\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ],\n          \"owner_unit_context\": {\n            \"evidence_conditions\": \"\",\n            \"synthesis\": \"\",\n            \"transition\": \"综上，本章确立了微生物组作为 ICI 疗效调节因子的观察性基础与转化边界，下一章将深入解析介导这些关联的具体分子与细胞机制。\",\n            \"argument_relations\": \"观察性证据最强 → 概念验证干预异质性大（阳性 vs 阴性） → Phase III 空白与安全信号情境依赖，确立当前证据阶梯分布与转化边界。\",\n            \"supporting_studies\": [\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"系统梳理FMT克服耐药的初步临床数据（ORR约20%）及机器学习预测性能，明确指出当前缺乏Phase III RCT证据且方法学异质性大，支撑“证据阶梯分布与转化边界”的批判性评估。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"0cf91befe63ec25329391e50e90d14093d3c74d7\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0026\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"汇总FMT及益生菌干预的早期临床试验结果，强调多数证据来自病例报告或小样本系列研究，安全性与长期维持效果尚不确定，用于界定概念验证阶段向常规临床应用转化的现实障碍。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"412cf94675e5be84f181d1075570015bc0b66c25\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0144\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"对比FMT、益生菌与饮食干预的临床效果差异，指出普通益生菌使用结果高度依赖菌株特异性且部分研究显示无效甚至有害，为讨论干预策略的异质性及安全性信号的情境依赖性提供核心素材。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"478e06158ac52abb764c678cb77109164cd00f5d\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0161\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"报告FMT-LUMINate II期试验中NSCLC患者ORR达80%，且响应源于基线有害菌种丢失而非供体定植，提供概念验证干预的初步希望及疗效归因线索。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0583\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"详述MITRIC IIa期篮子试验阴性结果(ORR 0%)，剖析快速进展疾病背景、供体匹配次优及髓系主导微环境限制等失败主因，界定FMT转化的现实边界。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"d9577b3a29bd8aec60c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0578\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"阐述A. muciniphila高丰度虽延长NSCLC患者OS但增加irAE风险，明确疗效与毒性在微生物层面的耦合关系，支撑安全性受ICI方案严格调节的情境依赖性论点。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"6f8044dc50ea73203f972ec2f8a2e2527694e3d3\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0260\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"系统梳理早期FMT及定义菌群临床试验现状，强调多数证据来自小样本探索性研究且缺乏大型RCT确证，直接呼应Phase III空白及转化医学的证据阶梯分布特征。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"8084192e33a8c5d78c74149b0e22d13f2ca24771\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0291\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"系统对比三类微生物干预措施（益生菌vs菌群组合vs FMT）的临床结局，指出FMT在难治性肿瘤中表现较一致ORR提升而益生菌效果高度特异，支撑“干预复杂度决定疗效”的证据阶梯判断。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"a7aa74ce68cc3094e2a185d973f39ba70ae017d9\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0387\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供肺癌幸存者长期随访数据，通过地标分析校正时间偏倚，揭示获益者特有的紧凑微生物网络与丁酸高产能力，以及irAEs患者的分子模拟表位富集，界定概念验证阶段向常规应用转化的现实边界。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"cc2b555e2b10a62d0141cb12ab5cefa6e47d570c\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0462\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提供涵盖特定菌属富集、抗生素暴露及FMT效果的定量荟萃分析结果，汇总群体水平的统计关联证据，用于评估当前证据等级及未来标准化需求的核心素材。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"d01d7681c26311e53a792fec4a5c6d8c608be0d6\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0470\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"通过人源化小鼠FMT实验确立irAEs发生的微生物因果链，并构建随机森林预测模型，为“安全性信号受宿主免疫背景与菌群特征共同驱动”提供机制与工具支撑。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:257062954\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0600\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"对比FMT、益生菌与工程菌的临床转化现状，指出供体筛选标准与给药方案异质性是导致概念验证试验结果分化的主因，界定当前干预策略的适用边界。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"ff51b7d7a956ceb17d4fb9e0f36c3446c6a4cf65\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0573\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"contribution\": \"提出肠道-代谢物-免疫轴框架，详述特定代谢物（如吲哚类、SCFAs）在减轻irAEs同时维持抗肿瘤活性的潜力，为平衡疗效与毒性提供分子干预思路。\",\n                \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:290154100\",\n                \"source_handle\": \"P0584\"\n              }\n            ]\n          },\n          \"unit_notes\": \"\",\n          \"source_handles\": [\n            \"P0583\",\n            \"P0584\",\n            \"P0026\",\n            \"P0144\",\n            \"P0161\",\n            \"P0291\",\n            \"P0387\",\n            \"P0470\",\n            \"P0573\",\n            \"P0578\",\n            \"P0273\",\n            \"P0260\",\n            \"P0462\",\n            \"P0600\",\n            \"P0577\"\n          ],\n          \"editable_task_ids\": [\n            \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P01\",\n            \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P02\",\n            \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P03\",\n            \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_T01\"\n          ],\n          \"task_keys\": {\n            \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n              \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界::U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P01\",\n              \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界::U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P02\",\n              \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界::U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P03\"\n            ],\n            \"table_tasks\": [\n              \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界::U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_T01\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"local_editable_task_ids\": [\n            \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界::U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P01\",\n            \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界::U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P02\",\n            \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界::U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_P03\",\n            \"U4_证据阶梯与转化边界::U4_证据阶梯与转化边界_T01\"\n          ],\n          \"fullbody_task_keys\": {\n            \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n              \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P01\",\n              \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P02\",\n              \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_P03\"\n            ],\n            \"table_tasks\": [\n              \"Ch1::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C::U4_%E8%AF%81%E6%8D%AE%E9%98%B6%E6%A2%AF%E4%B8%8E%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%BE%B9%E7%95%8C_T01\"\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"chapter_tool_materials\": [\n        {\n          \"need_id\": \"N83dc9b0b1022c7adee69-6671aee87d6d5629\",\n          \"question\": \"JCOG2007 III 期试验中肠道微生物组与 NSCLC 患者 ICI 疗效及毒性的具体关联数据是什么？\",\n          \"intended_use\": \"mechanism\",\n          \"decision\": \"answer_from_local\",\n          \"usable_content\": \"现有材料中未包含 JCOG2007 III 期试验的数据。提供的文献主要涉及 FMT-LUMINate II 期试验（P0583）以及关于肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效关联的综述（P0273, P0584）。P0583 报告了 FMT 联合 ICI 在 NSCLC 患者中的 ORR 为 80%，并指出响应者基线有害菌种丢失，而非供体菌株定植；P0273 和 P0584 总结了多项观察性研究和早期临床试验，强调微生物组特征（如 Akkermansia、Bifidobacterium 丰度）与 ICI 疗效及毒性的关联，但明确指出目前缺乏大型随机对照 III 期试验的证据。因此，无法从当前材料中提取 JCOG2007 试验的具体关联数据。\\n\\n在JCOG2007 III期试验的辅助生物标志物研究中，针对接受一线化疗联合免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，肠道微生物组组成与总生存期（OS）及严重不良事件（AEs）存在显著关联，且表现出方案特异性效应。具体而言，在尼莫鲁单抗+伊匹木单抗联合铂类双药化疗（NIC）组中，基线粪便中Fusicatenibacter和Butyricicoccus丰度较高的患者显示出更好的OS获益（相较于PC组，HR分别为0.56和0.52），且这些菌属的低丰度与发生≥4级严重不良事件的风险增加相关。相反，Prevotellaceae NK3B31的高丰度在NIC组中与更高的死亡风险相关（HR = 2.33）。该研究还发现，整体队列中OS超过12或18个月的亚群具有独特的微生物结构，富集了Fusicatenibacter、Butyricicoccus和Blautia。这些数据表明，特定细菌属的丰度可作为预测chemo-immunotherapy疗效和毒性的潜在生物标志物，但其效应依赖于具体的治疗 regimen（如NIC vs PC）。\\nJCOG2007 trial (ancillary biomarker study) / Hazard Ratio (HR) for Overall Survival (OS) = 0.56 / NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy) vs PC arm, patients with higher abundance of Fusicatenibacter：Higher Fusicatenibacter abundance in NIC arm: HR 0.56\\nJCOG2007 trial (ancillary biomarker study) / Hazard Ratio (HR) for Overall Survival (OS) = 0.52 / NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy) vs PC arm, patients with higher abundance of Butyricicoccus：Higher Butyricicoccus abundance in NIC arm: HR 0.52\\nJCOG2007 trial (ancillary biomarker study) / Hazard Ratio (HR) for Overall Survival (OS) = 2.33 / NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy), patients with higher abundance of Prevotellaceae NK3B31：Higher Prevotellaceae NK3B31 abundance in NIC arm: HR 2.33\",\n          \"conditions\": [\n            \"JCOG2007 trial (ancillary biomarker study)\",\n            \"NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy) vs PC arm, patients with higher abundance of Fusicatenibacter\",\n            \"NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy) vs PC arm, patients with higher abundance of Butyricicoccus\",\n            \"NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy), patients with higher abundance of Prevotellaceae NK3B31\"\n          ],\n          \"limits\": [],\n          \"still_missing\": \"\",\n          \"allowed_use\": [\n            \"background_context\",\n            \"explicit_objectives\",\n            \"explicit_method_summaries\",\n            \"explicit_reported_findings\",\n            \"explicit_leads\"\n          ],\n          \"sources\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"759b176490dcac135bff0b645dc106c3df8f4059\",\n              \"title\": \"The Gut Microbiome and Cancer Immunotherapy: Can We Use the Gut Microbiome as a Predictive Biomarker for Clinical Response in Cancer Immunotherapy?\",\n              \"year\": \"2021\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3390/cancers13194824\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"759b176490dcac135bff0b645dc106c3df8f4059\",\n              \"title\": \"The Gut Microbiome and Cancer Immunotherapy: Can We Use the Gut Microbiome as a Predictive Biomarker for Clinical Response in Cancer Immunotherapy?\",\n              \"year\": \"2021\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3390/cancers13194824\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:290154100\",\n              \"title\": \"Navigating the gut–metabolite–immune axis: enhancing efficacy and mitigating toxicity of immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1803970\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_identity\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"8016df1aa5a8160b7ccd412fa6851a6a508e2731\",\n              \"title\": \"Gut Microbiota in Advanced Non-small-cell Lung Cancer Receiving Chemo-immunotherapy: An Ancillary Biomarker Study from the Phase III trial JCOG2007 (NIPPON).\",\n              \"year\": \"2025\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.jtho.2025.02.026\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"b6efedbc1ffd0d54c8ed8ce3eb0a38c148e45450\",\n              \"title\": \"Impact of the gut microbiome on immune checkpoint inhibitor efficacy-a systematic review.\",\n              \"year\": \"2019\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3747/co.26.5177\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:285298099\",\n              \"title\": \"Engineering microbial metabolites to modulate tumor immunity and advance cancer immunotherapy\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1007/s44368-026-00019-w\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_handle\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"69b4c5f84be199181be6ab5d3124f306462234f3\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus pembrolizumab and axitinib in metastatic renal cell carcinoma: the randomized phase 2 TACITO trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04189-2\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_handle\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"261e0a3618ae7acf6e831646379929eff88857d5\",\n              \"title\": \"The Gut Microbiome from a Biomarker to a Novel Therapeutic Strategy for Immunotherapy Response in Patients with Lung Cancer\",\n              \"year\": \"2023\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3390/curroncol30110681\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0148\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"42b8755a18f7ff2ebb90765b502a37b6f6e868e5\",\n              \"title\": \"Response to immune checkpoint inhibition is associated with the gut microbiome in advanced KRAS-mutated non-small cell lung cancer\",\n              \"year\": \"2023\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1101/2023.10.30.23297712\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"c6b4401a8c45912fee23845cfc64d0fcec9315b7\",\n              \"title\": \"Interaction of bacterial genera associated with therapeutic response to immune checkpoint PD-1 blockade in a United States cohort\",\n              \"year\": \"2022\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1186/s13073-022-01037-7\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0604\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_handle\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0474\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"d227bde3dc62e02cfe87a58fa5173e149048ed4e\",\n              \"title\": \"Tumor microenvironment-mediated resistance to immune checkpoint inhibitors in non-small cell lung cancer: Mechanisms, combination strategies and clinical perspectives (Review)\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3892/mco.2026.2971\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0271\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"753e796b9f6fe2fe78f1b4c6074d39441710eda7\",\n              \"title\": \"The role of the gut microbiome on the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors in Japanese responder patients with advanced non-small cell lung cancer.\",\n              \"year\": \"2019\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.21037/tlcr.2019.10.23\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:290154100\",\n              \"title\": \"Navigating the gut–metabolite–immune axis: enhancing efficacy and mitigating toxicity of immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1803970\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_identity\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"8016df1aa5a8160b7ccd412fa6851a6a508e2731\",\n              \"title\": \"Gut Microbiota in Advanced Non-small-cell Lung Cancer Receiving Chemo-immunotherapy: An Ancillary Biomarker Study from the Phase III trial JCOG2007 (NIPPON).\",\n              \"year\": \"2025\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.jtho.2025.02.026\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:285298099\",\n              \"title\": \"Engineering microbial metabolites to modulate tumor immunity and advance cancer immunotherapy\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1007/s44368-026-00019-w\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_handle\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"69b4c5f84be199181be6ab5d3124f306462234f3\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus pembrolizumab and axitinib in metastatic renal cell carcinoma: the randomized phase 2 TACITO trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04189-2\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_handle\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0096\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"261e0a3618ae7acf6e831646379929eff88857d5\",\n              \"title\": \"The Gut Microbiome from a Biomarker to a Novel Therapeutic Strategy for Immunotherapy Response in Patients with Lung Cancer\",\n              \"year\": \"2023\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3390/curroncol30110681\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"provenance\": {\n            \"downloads\": 0,\n            \"model_calls\": 0,\n            \"source\": \"judge+focused_local_read\",\n            \"whole_paper_rereads\": 0\n          },\n          \"chapter_ids\": [\n            \"Ch1\",\n            \"Ch4\"\n          ],\n          \"unit_key\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"need_id\": \"N61bd5cdf82bc1980ec2a-fe99d495492aaf34\",\n          \"question\": \"是否有已完成的大型随机对照 III 期临床试验证实微生物干预（如 FMT）在 ICI 治疗实体瘤中的疗效？\",\n          \"intended_use\": \"application_outcome\",\n          \"decision\": \"provider_retry\",\n          \"usable_content\": \"现有数据与用户询问的“已完成大型随机对照 III 期临床试验”设置不一致，提供的证据主要为 I/II 期研究，且研究设计（RCT vs 单臂）与人群（初治 vs 经治）存在差异。TACITO 试验（Phase 2a RCT）中，d-FMT 组相较于 p-FMT 组在 12 个月 PFS 率、中位 PFS 及中位 OS 上数值更高，提示正向差异，但原文未提供统计检验结果，不能认定具有统计学显著性。单臂试验结果方向不一致：ICI 经治人群（MITRIC 试验）ORR 为 0%，提示负向或无疗效；而初治黑色素瘤（MIMic 试验）或 NSCLC/黑色素瘤（FMT-LUMINate 试验）ORR 介于 65%-80%，提示正向差异。这表明微生物干预疗效可能受治疗线数影响，但缺乏 III 期 RCT 证实。\\n\\n适用条件：仅基于提供的 I/II 期试验数据；数值差异不代表统计显著；不包含用户指定的 III 期 RCT 证据；不推断未报告的机制。\\nTACITO trial (P0593) / 12-month PFS rate / Phase 2a RCT, mRCC, first-line：d-FMT: 70%；p-FMT: 41%\\nTACITO trial (P0593) / Median PFS / Phase 2a RCT, mRCC, first-line：d-FMT: 24.0 months；p-FMT: 9.0 months\\nTACITO trial (P0593) / Median OS / Phase 2a RCT, mRCC, first-line：d-FMT: 41.0 months；p-FMT: 28.3 months\\nMITRIC trial (P0578) / ORR / Phase IIa single-arm, ICI-refractory：All patients (n=12): 0%\\nMITRIC trial (P0578) / Median PFS / Phase IIa single-arm, ICI-refractory：All patients (n=12): 1.5 months\\nMIMic trial (P0577) / ORR / Phase I single-arm, first-line melanoma：All patients (n=20): 65%\\nMIMic trial (P0577) / Median PFS / Phase I single-arm, first-line melanoma：All patients (n=20): 29.6 months\\nFMT-LUMINate (P0583) / ORR / Phase 2 single-arm, NSCLC：NSCLC cohort: 80%\\nFMT-LUMINate (P0583) / ORR / Phase 2 single-arm, Melanoma：Melanoma cohort: 75%\",\n          \"conditions\": [\n            \"TACITO trial (P0593)\",\n            \"Phase 2a RCT, mRCC, first-line\",\n            \"MITRIC trial (P0578)\",\n            \"Phase IIa single-arm, ICI-refractory\",\n            \"MIMic trial (P0577)\",\n            \"Phase I single-arm, first-line melanoma\",\n            \"FMT-LUMINate (P0583)\",\n            \"Phase 2 single-arm, NSCLC\",\n            \"Phase 2 single-arm, Melanoma\"\n          ],\n          \"limits\": [\n            \"已完成并发表主要结局数据的 Phase III RCT 研究（如注册号为 NCT 开头的 III 期试验结果）。\"\n          ],\n          \"still_missing\": \"已完成并发表主要结局数据的 Phase III RCT 研究（如注册号为 NCT 开头的 III 期试验结果）。\",\n          \"allowed_use\": [\n            \"background_context\",\n            \"explicit_objectives\",\n            \"explicit_method_summaries\",\n            \"explicit_reported_findings\",\n            \"explicit_leads\"\n          ],\n          \"sources\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"d9577b3a29bd8aec60c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\",\n              \"title\": \"Safety and efficacy of fecal microbiota transplantation in solid cancers resistant to immune checkpoint inhibitors: results of the MITRIC trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2026-015122\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"d9577b3a29bd8aec60c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\",\n              \"title\": \"Safety and efficacy of fecal microbiota transplantation in solid cancers resistant to immune checkpoint inhibitors: results of the MITRIC trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2026-015122\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"69b4c5f84be199181be6ab5d3124f306462234f3\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus pembrolizumab and axitinib in metastatic renal cell carcinoma: the randomized phase 2 TACITO trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04189-2\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_handle\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"69b4c5f84be199181be6ab5d3124f306462234f3\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus pembrolizumab and axitinib in metastatic renal cell carcinoma: the randomized phase 2 TACITO trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04189-2\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0593\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_handle\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"a1c056e6d54a3498db16737d087fae44f686a900\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation improves anti-PD-1 inhibitor efficacy in unresectable or metastatic solid cancers refractory to anti-PD-1 inhibitor.\",\n              \"year\": \"2024\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.chom.2024.06.010\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0594\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_handle\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"20c143d5373eab0bfea2067cf66b0e260dfeb1ef\",\n              \"title\": \"Improved survival in advanced melanoma patients treated with fecal microbiota transplantation using healthy donor stool in combination with anti-PD1: final results of the MIMic phase 1 trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2025\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2025-012659\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:290154100\",\n              \"title\": \"Navigating the gut–metabolite–immune axis: enhancing efficacy and mitigating toxicity of immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1803970\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_identity\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"20c143d5373eab0bfea2067cf66b0e260dfeb1ef\",\n              \"title\": \"Improved survival in advanced melanoma patients treated with fecal microbiota transplantation using healthy donor stool in combination with anti-PD1: final results of the MIMic phase 1 trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2025\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2025-012659\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"20c143d5373eab0bfea2067cf66b0e260dfeb1ef\",\n              \"title\": \"Improved survival in advanced melanoma patients treated with fecal microbiota transplantation using healthy donor stool in combination with anti-PD1: final results of the MIMic phase 1 trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2025\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2025-012659\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"20c143d5373eab0bfea2067cf66b0e260dfeb1ef\",\n              \"title\": \"Improved survival in advanced melanoma patients treated with fecal microbiota transplantation using healthy donor stool in combination with anti-PD1: final results of the MIMic phase 1 trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2025\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2025-012659\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"20c143d5373eab0bfea2067cf66b0e260dfeb1ef\",\n              \"title\": \"Improved survival in advanced melanoma patients treated with fecal microbiota transplantation using healthy donor stool in combination with anti-PD1: final results of the MIMic phase 1 trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2025\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2025-012659\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"d9577b3a29bd8aec60c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\",\n              \"title\": \"Safety and efficacy of fecal microbiota transplantation in solid cancers resistant to immune checkpoint inhibitors: results of the MITRIC trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2026-015122\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"d9577b3a29bd8aec60c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\",\n              \"title\": \"Safety and efficacy of fecal microbiota transplantation in solid cancers resistant to immune checkpoint inhibitors: results of the MITRIC trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2026-015122\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"d9577b3a29bd8aec60c9e27c6a56a63faf3f4a27\",\n              \"title\": \"Safety and efficacy of fecal microbiota transplantation in solid cancers resistant to immune checkpoint inhibitors: results of the MITRIC trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1136/jitc-2026-015122\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"chapter_ids\": [],\n          \"unit_key\": \"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"need_id\": \"N83dc9b0b1022c7adee69-6671aee87d6d5629\",\n          \"question\": \"JCOG2007 III 期试验中肠道微生物组与 NSCLC 患者 ICI 疗效及毒性的具体关联数据是什么？\",\n          \"intended_use\": \"mechanism\",\n          \"decision\": \"answer_from_local\",\n          \"usable_content\": \"现有材料中未包含 JCOG2007 III 期试验的数据。提供的文献主要涉及 FMT-LUMINate II 期试验（P0583）以及关于肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效关联的综述（P0273, P0584）。P0583 报告了 FMT 联合 ICI 在 NSCLC 患者中的 ORR 为 80%，并指出响应者基线有害菌种丢失，而非供体菌株定植；P0273 和 P0584 总结了多项观察性研究和早期临床试验，强调微生物组特征（如 Akkermansia、Bifidobacterium 丰度）与 ICI 疗效及毒性的关联，但明确指出目前缺乏大型随机对照 III 期试验的证据。因此，无法从当前材料中提取 JCOG2007 试验的具体关联数据。\\n\\n在JCOG2007 III期试验的辅助生物标志物研究中，针对接受一线化疗联合免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，肠道微生物组组成与总生存期（OS）及严重不良事件（AEs）存在显著关联，且表现出方案特异性效应。具体而言，在尼莫鲁单抗+伊匹木单抗联合铂类双药化疗（NIC）组中，基线粪便中Fusicatenibacter和Butyricicoccus丰度较高的患者显示出更好的OS获益（相较于PC组，HR分别为0.56和0.52），且这些菌属的低丰度与发生≥4级严重不良事件的风险增加相关。相反，Prevotellaceae NK3B31的高丰度在NIC组中与更高的死亡风险相关（HR = 2.33）。该研究还发现，整体队列中OS超过12或18个月的亚群具有独特的微生物结构，富集了Fusicatenibacter、Butyricicoccus和Blautia。这些数据表明，特定细菌属的丰度可作为预测chemo-immunotherapy疗效和毒性的潜在生物标志物，但其效应依赖于具体的治疗 regimen（如NIC vs PC）。\\nJCOG2007 trial (ancillary biomarker study) / Hazard Ratio (HR) for Overall Survival (OS) = 0.56 / NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy) vs PC arm, patients with higher abundance of Fusicatenibacter：Higher Fusicatenibacter abundance in NIC arm: HR 0.56\\nJCOG2007 trial (ancillary biomarker study) / Hazard Ratio (HR) for Overall Survival (OS) = 0.52 / NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy) vs PC arm, patients with higher abundance of Butyricicoccus：Higher Butyricicoccus abundance in NIC arm: HR 0.52\\nJCOG2007 trial (ancillary biomarker study) / Hazard Ratio (HR) for Overall Survival (OS) = 2.33 / NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy), patients with higher abundance of Prevotellaceae NK3B31：Higher Prevotellaceae NK3B31 abundance in NIC arm: HR 2.33\",\n          \"conditions\": [\n            \"JCOG2007 trial (ancillary biomarker study)\",\n            \"NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy) vs PC arm, patients with higher abundance of Fusicatenibacter\",\n            \"NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy) vs PC arm, patients with higher abundance of Butyricicoccus\",\n            \"NIC arm (Nivolumab-ipilimumab + platinum doublet chemotherapy), patients with higher abundance of Prevotellaceae NK3B31\"\n          ],\n          \"limits\": [],\n          \"still_missing\": \"\",\n          \"allowed_use\": [\n            \"background_context\",\n            \"explicit_objectives\",\n            \"explicit_method_summaries\",\n            \"explicit_reported_findings\",\n            \"explicit_leads\"\n          ],\n          \"sources\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"071823eff68d7dbea395490dd4643170131b5f6a\",\n              \"title\": \"Fecal microbiota transplantation plus immunotherapy in non-small cell lung cancer and melanoma: the phase 2 FMT-LUMINate trial\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-025-04186-5\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"759b176490dcac135bff0b645dc106c3df8f4059\",\n              \"title\": \"The Gut Microbiome and Cancer Immunotherapy: Can We Use the Gut Microbiome as a Predictive Biomarker for Clinical Response in Cancer Immunotherapy?\",\n              \"year\": \"2021\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3390/cancers13194824\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0273\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"759b176490dcac135bff0b645dc106c3df8f4059\",\n              \"title\": \"The Gut Microbiome and Cancer Immunotherapy: Can We Use the Gut Microbiome as a Predictive Biomarker for Clinical Response in Cancer Immunotherapy?\",\n              \"year\": \"2021\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3390/cancers13194824\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"paper_id\": \"CorpusId:290154100\",\n              \"title\": \"Navigating the gut–metabolite–immune axis: enhancing efficacy and mitigating toxicity of immune checkpoint inhibitors\",\n              \"year\": \"2026\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2026.1803970\",\n              \"original_source_handle\": \"P0584\",\n              \"identity_status\": \"conflicting_identity\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"8016df1aa5a8160b7ccd412fa6851a6a508e2731\",\n              \"title\": \"Gut Microbiota in Advanced Non-small-cell Lung Cancer Receiving Chemo-immunotherapy: An Ancillary Biomarker Study from the Phase III trial JCOG2007 (NIPPON).\",\n              \"year\": \"2025\",\n              \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.jtho.2025.02.026\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0417\",\n              \"paper_id\": \"b6efedbc1